{"v":1,"book":"Ps","ch":81,"verses":[{"n":0,"text":"For the Chief Musician. On an instrument of Gath. By Asaph."},{"n":1,"text":"Sing aloud to God, our strength! Make a joyful shout to the God of Jacob!","tok":[{"t":"Sing aloud "},{"t":"to","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" God, "},{"t":"our","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" strength! Make "},{"t":"a","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" joyful shout "},{"t":"to","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" God "},{"t":"of","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" Jacob!"}]},{"n":2,"text":"Raise a song, and bring here the tambourine, the pleasant lyre with the harp.","tok":[{"t":"Raise","s":["H7321"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"a","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" song, "},{"t":"and","s":["H3290"]},{"t":" bring here "},{"t":"the","s":["H7321"]},{"t":" tambourine, "},{"t":"the","s":["H7321"]},{"t":" pleasant lyre "},{"t":"with","s":["H7442"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H7321"]},{"t":" harp."}]},{"n":3,"text":"Blow the trumpet at the New Moon, at the full moon, on our feast day.","tok":[{"t":"Blow "},{"t":"the","s":["H5414"]},{"t":" trumpet "},{"t":"at","s":["H5414"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H5414"]},{"t":" New Moon, "},{"t":"at","s":["H5414"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H5414"]},{"t":" full moon, "},{"t":"on","s":["H5375"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"our","s":["H5414"]},{"t":" feast day."}]},{"n":4,"text":"For it is a statute for Israel, an ordinance of the God of Jacob.","tok":[{"t":"For","s":["H3117"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"it","s":["H3117"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"is","s":["H3117"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"a","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" statute "},{"t":"for","s":["H3117"]},{"t":" Israel, "},{"t":"an","s":["H8628"]},{"t":" ordinance "},{"t":"of","s":["H3117"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H3117"]},{"t":" God "},{"t":"of","s":["H3117"]},{"t":" Jacob."}]},{"n":5,"text":"He appointed it in Joseph for a covenant, when he went out over the land of Egypt, I heard a language that I didn’t know.","tok":[{"t":"He","s":["H1931"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"appointed","s":["H2706"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"it","s":["H1931"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"in","